# The HDR quarry sky (sun behind the camera) plus one small, bright lamp:
# next event estimation picks between them. Uniform selection sends half of
# the shadow rays to the lamp, which emits 0.6% of the light (sky: pi R^2
# times its radiance integrated over the sphere, R the scene's radius); power
# selection (the default) gives the sky 90% of them: 99.4% by power, with 20%
# of the choices kept uniform as a safeguard (see light_list.h). Compare with
# "light_selection uniform" (renders/12-light-selection-*.png).
#
# textures/quarry_01_1k.hdr: "Quarry 01" by Greg Zaal, Poly Haven (CC0).

image_width  480
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 16
max_depth    16

camera lookfrom 0 1.2 5  lookat 0 0.45 0  vfov 32

environment ../textures/quarry_01_1k.hdr  rotate 280
exposure    -1
tonemap     aces
light_selection power

material floor  principled color 0.6 0.6 0.6 roughness 0.6
material white  lambertian 0.8 0.8 0.8
material gold   metal 1.0 0.78 0.34 0.25
material glass  dielectric 1.5
material paint  principled color 0.7 0.08 0.05 roughness 0.3
material lamp   emissive 15 12 9

quad   -6 0 -6  12 0 0  0 0 12  floor
sphere -1.65 0.5 0    0.5  white
sphere -0.55 0.5 0    0.5  gold
sphere  0.55 0.5 0    0.5  glass
sphere  1.65 0.5 0    0.5  paint
sphere  0    0.15 1.0 0.15 lamp
